---
// IndustriesGrowth.astro
// "Where We Are Growing" — 3 target/growth sector cards.
// Background: WHITE + blue square grid (light section)
// Cards: navy gradient on light section
---

<style>
  /* ── WHITE + BLUE GRID BACKGROUND ── */
  .target-sectors {
    padding-block: clamp(48px, 8vh, 96px);
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(8,56,146,.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8,56,146,.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(8,56,146,.08);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Header row */
  .section-header {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px);
    margin-bottom: clamp(28px, 4vh, 52px);
  }

  /* Section tag — crimson on light bg */
  .section-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-tag .line { width: 28px; height: 2px; background: #c0181e; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .section-tag span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c0181e;
  }

  /* Headline — navy + red accent (light section) */
  .section-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 800; 
    font-size:clamp(32px,4.5vw,56px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: .97;
    color: rgba(8,56,146,.9);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .section-headline .accent { color: #c0181e; }

  /* Intro copy — dark on light */
  .intro-copy {
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 16px);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #2a3550;
    max-width: 720px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* Card grid */
  .cards-wrap {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px);
  }

  .target-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px)  { .target-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .target-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; } }

  /* Card — navy gradient on light section */
  .target-card {
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 70% at 35% 40%, rgba(8,56,146,0.9) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 95% 90%, rgba(192,24,30,.07) 0%, transparent 50%),
      linear-gradient(155deg, var(--navy-deep) 0%, var(--ink) 55%, var(--black) 100%);
    padding: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--teal-l, #14a898);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.14);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-top-color .25s, box-shadow .25s, transform .25s;
  }
  .target-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.24);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .target-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; right: 0;
    width: 80px; height: 80px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(20,168,152,.08), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Icon — teal on navy card */
  .tc-icon {
    width: 38px; height: 38px;
    color: var(--teal-l, #14a898);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    opacity: .9;
  }

  /* Card name — white on navy */
  .tc-name {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 24px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  /* Status badge */
  .tc-status {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: rgba(20,168,152,.15);
    color: var(--teal-l, #14a898);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  /* Description — fog on navy */
  .tc-desc {
    font-size: clamp(12px, 1.3vw, 14px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--fog);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  /* Opportunity block */
  .tc-opportunity {
    font-size: clamp(12px, 1.2vw, 14px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #8898b0;
    line-height: 1.65;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(20,168,152,.15);
    padding-top: 14px;
  }
  .tc-opportunity strong {
    color: var(--teal-l, #14a898);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  /* Reveal */
  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); transition: opacity .65s ease, transform .65s ease; }
  .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } }
</style>

<section class="target-sectors" id="target" aria-labelledby="target-heading">

  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-tag reveal">
      <div class="line"></div>
      <span>Where We Are Growing</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="section-headline reveal" id="target-heading">
      Equipment Ready.<br><span class="accent">Experience Transferable.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="intro-copy reveal">
      The equipment we build for cement plants, mines, and food processing operations is
      the same equipment these sectors need — the material characteristics differ, the
      engineering principles do not. If your operation handles bulk solids, powders, or
      granular material, Jayveecons has fabricated something like it before.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="cards-wrap">
    <div class="target-grid">

      <!-- Oil & Gas -->
      <article class="target-card reveal" aria-label="Oil and Gas sector">
        <svg class="tc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/>
          <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
          <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
          <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="tc-name">Oil &amp; Gas</h3>
        <div class="tc-status">Diversifying With Proven Equipment</div>
        <p class="tc-desc">
          Upstream and midstream oil and gas operations move large volumes of bulk solids —
          proppants (frac sand), drilling muds, barite, and bentonite in drilling; petroleum
          coke, catalyst fines, and sulphur in refining. These materials demand enclosed,
          leak-proof conveying systems and pressure-rated containment vessels.
        </p>
        <div class="tc-opportunity">
          <strong>What we bring</strong>
          Enclosed screw conveyors for dusty and hazardous bulk solids; belt and bucket
          systems for high-volume proppant handling; fabricated pressure vessels and storage
          systems; abrasion-resistant material selection from our mining work. ASME
          documentation available where specified.
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Pharmaceuticals -->
      <article class="target-card reveal" aria-label="Pharmaceuticals sector">
        <svg class="tc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M9 3H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v4m6-6h10a2 2 0 012 2v4M9 3v18m0 0h10a2 2 0 002-2V9M9 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9m0 0h18"/>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="tc-name">Pharmaceuticals</h3>
        <div class="tc-status">Diversifying With Proven Equipment</div>
        <p class="tc-desc">
          Pharmaceutical bulk handling requires precision, containment, and cleanability
          above all else. APIs, excipients, and formulation powders must be transferred
          without contamination, with full material traceability and equipment construction
          that permits clean-in-place or strip-down cleaning.
        </p>
        <div class="tc-opportunity">
          <strong>What we bring</strong>
          Stainless steel screw conveyors and bucket elevators to Ra surface finish
          requirements; crevice-free weld geometry; contained transfer points; IBC handling
          systems; full material certification. Our food-grade fabrication experience is the
          direct foundation for pharma-grade work.
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Agriculture Processing -->
      <article class="target-card reveal" aria-label="Agriculture Processing sector">
        <svg class="tc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 100 20A10 10 0 0012 2z"/>
          <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
          <path d="M2 12h4M18 12h4M12 6V2M12 22v-4"/>
        </svg>
        <h3 class="tc-name">Agriculture Processing</h3>
        <div class="tc-status">Diversifying With Proven Equipment</div>
        <p class="tc-desc">
          Industrial-scale post-harvest operations — grain reception and storage, oilseed
          crushing, rice milling, sugar processing, and animal feed compounding — require
          handling systems that are high-throughput, gentle on product quality, and designed
          for the seasonal intensity of harvest intake.
        </p>
        <div class="tc-opportunity">
          <strong>What we bring</strong>
          High-capacity bucket elevators and belt conveyors for grain intake; flat-bottom
          and hopper-bottom silos with aeration systems; rotary dryers for harvested grain
          moisture reduction; screw conveyors and feeders for milling and blending.
          Food-safe material selection is standard.
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>

</section>